  "title": "Pumpkin Layer Cheesecake",
  "description": "This cheesecake makes a dramatic presentation with its two layers of white and pumpkin. It&#39;s easy to make, too, by using a prepared graham cracker crust.",
  "authors": [
    "JPOTTER"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:05:22-04:00",
